sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box rgb(227,242,253) Public Zone
    participant P as Proposer (processes:migration:manage)
    participant A as Second holder (processes:migration:manage)
  end
  box rgb(224,242,241) Host service
    participant X as MigrationExecutionService
    participant W as MigrationRunner (job poller, every replica)
  end
  box rgb(255,248,225) Host PostgreSQL
    participant DB as pre_migration, pre_migration_instance, pre_instance, pre_token
  end
  P->>X: POST /migrations/{id}:execute, reason, Idempotency-Key
  rect rgb(255,248,225)
    Note over X,DB: TX, sync: lock the plan row, dry run on the server, write the proposal
    X->>DB: dry run (reads only), conflicts give 409 DRY_RUN_REQUIRED
    X->>DB: status PROPOSED, PROPOSED history row, processes.migration.proposed.v1, COMMIT
  end
  X-->>P: 202 proposal, lockVersion 1
  W->>DB: claim APPROVED or RUNNING plans: none, a proposal is not runnable
  A->>X: POST /migrations/{id}:approve, If-Match "1"
  rect rgb(255,248,225)
    Note over X,DB: TX, sync: the proposer is refused with 403, dry run repeated and still fresh
    X->>DB: status APPROVED (approver is not the proposer, checked by the table), APPROVED history row, COMMIT
  end
  X-->>A: 200 execution APPROVED
  W->>DB: claim the plan FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, lease for migration.lease
  loop batches of migration.batch-size, each instance in its own transaction
    W->>DB: next running instances after the cursor (idx_pre_instance_running_definition)
    rect rgb(255,248,225)
      Note over W,DB: TX per instance, sync
      W->>DB: lock the instance row NOWAIT, check live tokens against the target steps
      alt step kept with the same type
        W->>DB: repoint instance, tokens, tasks, jobs, results, incidents to v2, MIGRATED history, outcome row
        W->>DB: pass the cursor, count it, extend the lease only while this replica holds it
      else cannot move
        W->>DB: roll back this instance, second TX: incident MIGRATION_FAILED, outcome FAILED, count it
      end
    end
  end
  W->>DB: no instance left: COMPLETED or COMPLETED_WITH_FAILURES, processes.migration.completed.v1
